        "kind": "derived",
        "step": "On a 3-CNF formula with s variables plus clauses, Molter’s reduction produces a triangle-free graph of width O(√s) in 2^{O(√s log(s+2))} time. Substituting the width bound gives a fixed power saving in the exponent for 3-SAT."
